  "description": "No! The beloved young master has died again!\n\nWhen the young master of a game dies for the 43rd time, the 44th round begins, followed by a strange voice and a new job, character, and storyline. From there, Lynne's beloved child-rearing sim begins to take a weird turn, becoming more like a dating sim! Can she save the young master again amidst these oddities?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
